# D-Eye environment example -- PLACEHOLDERS ONLY. Never commit real values.
# The core works with NONE of these set (FOSS-first, keyless search default).

# Optional hosted search adapter (Exa). Leave unset to use the keyless default.
# EXA_API_KEY=your-exa-key-here

# Where D-Eye stores config + exported research packets (owner-only, 0700).
# DEYE_HOME=~/.deye
